                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 video-container shadow-sm rounded">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="{{asset('img/img24.png')}}" class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-3">What exactly is Investment Financing?</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                    <strong>Investment Financing</strong> encompasses strategies and financial tools implemented to acquire assets (financial, real estate, businesses) with the goal of generating income or capital gains in the medium or long term. This can include specific investment loans, <strong>private equity solutions</strong>, or complex financial arrangements for large-scale projects. We help you identify the best opportunities and structure the most suitable financing for your investor profile and your wealth or professional growth objectives.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 feature-row" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
