                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Privileged Access:** Connection to a network of exclusive investment opportunities.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Risk Management:** Optimization of the risk/return ratio for increased security.</li>
